{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-15_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-15","title":"回答我","storyCode":"11-17","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c39036d23bdf0c7ddb1ffb8a31db4902a475aea3bce94e90c490f45a86ecf7d9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚粗口*，这些新来的敌人怎么这么硬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，一起冲上去！冲......冲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来！别靠近！离那些已经死去的人远......远......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......怎、怎么回事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在倒下的战士周围，一股前所未见的力量正在战场上弥漫。\n有什么东西源源不断地从他们的皮肤上、眼睛里、耳鼻中析出来。不是血液，不是什么实质上的器官组织。\n或许是恐惧，一种对死后的未知的恐惧。这种无法对抗的恐惧正在迅速地带走他们的生命力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"退后！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又能呼吸了！谢谢你，罗德岛的......医生？可露希尔小姐说你是医生，没......错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有人，退到我身后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是......巫术？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我闻到了和温迪戈的祭坛差不多的味道。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹的古老巫术，都有着相似的发源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"“死亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"温迪戈，食腐者，血魔，石翼魔，巫妖......甚至女妖。死亡是大多数生物的终点，却是许多萨卡兹汲取力量的源头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的剑......挡住了污染的蔓延？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......死亡与生命从来都是硬币的两面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我能阻挡的时间很有限。我们对抗不了食腐者的军队，即便抵达此处的只是他麾下的先锋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"那位古老的萨卡兹鞭笞着腐败与死亡蠕行于战场，我也只是在过去听闻过些许传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们得赶快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我知道。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"凯尔希已给出了明确的撤退讯号。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（急切的尖啸）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔，立刻回收无人机。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......没办法了对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数据回传......百分之七十......好，就这么多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"费斯特，去找克洛维希娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，跟上我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛的各位，跟上Mon3tr！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"罗德岛的各位，按计划掩护自救军撤退！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"还有阿米娅他们。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"通知阿米娅、Logos和阿斯卡纶。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"没有回音。\n你的呼叫没有任何结果。\n不对劲。即便是在最激烈的战斗中，阿米娅都不会轻易忽视你的声音。\nPRTS并不能显示干员们的处境，可你已经意识到了她正面临着多大的危险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，食腐者提前到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生的速度已经够快，拖延巫妖的脚步已是极限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者麾下军士的凝聚力远胜任何萨卡兹势力，他们的行动会非常迅速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"撤退？\n不。\n他们无法逃脱。血魔的鲜血桎梏可以劈开，食腐者的死亡浸染可以抵挡，但只要他们逃不出这片大地，就逃不过阴云的注视。\n因为属于萨卡兹的恨意与悲痛本就无处不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无数声音涌进她的脑海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她听见在战争中失去父母的孩子一边走在废墟中一边轻轻呜咽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她听见稚嫩的战士第一次挥剑斩向敌人头颅时，剑锋传来的闷响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她听见女妖身披银月，面朝脏乱畸形的都城，一遍遍地吟诵刚刚学来的咒文。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她听见血魔的轻笑，他独自一人站在峡谷中，将无数冲向萨卡兹聚落的敌人化作血海。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她听见死去的魂灵们正背朝天空，对着大地吼叫。\n凭什么就该我们死去？\n就因为我们是萨卡兹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的线条正不受控制地从她的眼睛里、口鼻中涌出来，不断地延伸，不断地缠绕。\n所有萨卡兹的心脏都像是被黑色的丝线抓住了一瞬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。别被影响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，博士，我听到了......我听到了什么声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊不清的萨卡兹某部族语言*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下充斥黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑暗滋生邪恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邪恶带来痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊不清的萨卡兹某部族语言*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔在说什么？我听不太懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好晕......我的脑袋......是不是坏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，是萨卡兹的巫术在攻击我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我没有感觉......呃，快看，敌人也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑暗......痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分享......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我听过这段话。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我听过类似的语言。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一种特殊的精神暗示。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一种并不常规的法术。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，请立刻跟随自救军与其他干员撤离。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是阿米娅......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"闪灵......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"连你也受到了影响？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"失控的力量正在侵蚀所有萨卡兹的心灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"就连赦罪师都无法抵御......即便我暂时可以忍受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"失控的力量？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"难道是......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"只有萨卡兹的君主，能够将将士们渴望的愿景作为抚慰，也能调动叛徒们内心最深处的恐惧当作惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"只有“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什么，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想......正在无差别攻击所有萨卡兹的，究竟是哪一位魔王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅很危险。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是我最担心的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"无论动手的人是不是特蕾西娅。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王的力量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你这样未经锤炼的身躯，怎么可能承受得住萨卡兹万年的回忆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪......难怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你承受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上的那些戒指......是特蕾西娅留给你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们以为这样就能将馈赠与诅咒一同锁住，却忘了赠予之物亦可被收回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，你应该也有所察觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是殿下在影响阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战况已不允许任何拖延。食腐者与特雷西斯随时可能现身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，我们必须将阿米娅强行带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戒指上并没有裂纹，也没有变色。\n它们只是在颤抖。因为她在颤抖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你配不上特蕾西娅传予你的冠冕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并非因为你不是萨卡兹，而是因为你从未试图理解过萨卡兹的本质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你与特蕾西娅一样，被那个自称凯尔希的怪物蒙蔽了双目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为萨卡兹和菲林一样，是由近似的血脉联系在一起的某支种族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当我们的愤怒只是在对抗某种不公正的待遇，你把我们对他们的抗争当作国与国之间的争斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而真的是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我邀请你直视我的愤恨，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我邀请你......好好听一听头顶阴云中的恸哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会告诉你，萨卡兹与那些可耻的侵略者......你们口中的神民与先民从来不是同类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔也从来不是一座都城，一个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萨卡兹还被称作提卡兹，还拥有家园的那个年代——卡兹戴尔指的是我们目所能及的整个世界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔本应与泰拉同义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"无止境的悲哀包裹着她，缠住她的手脚，堵住她的口鼻。\n不管她看向哪里，阴云都填满了她的视野。\n要如何才能逃脱？凭什么能够逃脱？\n她只能听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个萨卡兹爬上城墙。\n他的身后是一座铁灰色的城市，他的头顶飘扬着黑色的旗帜。\n伤痕累累的战士们在身前列阵。与他差不多年纪却未经训练的萨卡兹则手握生锈的刀剑守着城墙。\n另有无数同胞正站在他的身后，他们或老或少，手里握着的可能只是打猎用的弓弩。\n而敌人已经踏过荒原，来到他们的城市跟前。\n他听到高塔术师的法杖整齐地划开空气。\n他听到高卢炮兵操控着源石炮转向。\n他听到蒸汽甲胄行军时沉重的脚步声，以及冲刺时的喷气声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i07"},{"type":"narration","text":"他听到风把领头将领的衣袍吹起，与甲胄相撞，发出冰冷的声音。\n那个菲林是谁？蒸汽骑士就站在她的身后。她是维多利亚的将领？可是高塔术师与高卢炮兵也都听从她的指挥。\n他听到她开口宣判着萨卡兹的罪行。\n“我知晓萨卡兹正在筹划的一切。仇恨是无法治愈的绝症，你们的复仇将会为大地带来无法治愈的伤痕。”\n“为了周围诸国的安定，为了之后两百年的和平，野心必须被提前消灭。”\n大火从四面八方涌向卡兹戴尔。又一座卡兹戴尔即将变成废墟。无数萨卡兹在这场大火里前赴后继地死去，而走出大火的只会更加不幸。\n为什么要杀死我？\n只因为我们有着不同的起源？只因为这片大地已经承载不了我们的怨恨，就要提前将我们全部抹去？\n六位英雄从废墟之中站起。他们扛起燃烧着的卡兹戴尔的旗帜，向面前的大军发起冲锋。\n没有一个萨卡兹会心甘情愿地死去。刚刚倒下的成千上万的萨卡兹们的悲号化作战鼓，跟随着英雄们的脚步奔向敌军。\n回答我，仇敌！\n你是什么人，凭什么能够决定卡兹戴尔应当覆灭？\n你是什么人，凭什么能够审判萨卡兹的所做作为？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"为什么不说话？\n为什么不回答我的问题？\n凯尔希......凯尔希！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔的城墙正在坍塌。伴随着灰烬与残垣，死去的萨卡兹也在下坠。\n她在下坠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脑袋好像没那么晕了......呃，我能看见东西了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，塔上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅！！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔，无人机！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"刺客挡住了血魔的追击。\n咒术大师延缓了坠落的速度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滑索绑在你的身上，无人机拉着你迅速穿过这片战场。\n在阿米娅的身体快要触到地面之前，你抓住了她的手，将她抱在怀中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，为什么......阿米娅一直在念凯尔希的名字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你在阿米娅的眼角看到了悲哀的泪水，却也在她紧皱的眉间读出了愤怒。\n她到底看到了什么，又听到了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，博士，有什么正在迅速靠近——等，这么快？！在哪儿？！快找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他......一开始就在......那、那里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"人影。\n一个萨卡兹无声地投来视线。\n与血魔那黏稠的杀意截然不同，亦没有赦罪师傲慢的蔑视或食腐者恐怖的气息，与那位温迪戈相比，他的身形甚至稍显瘦小。\n只是一个萨卡兹。没有军队，没有侍从，从王座上突兀地站起，放下他从未真正在意过的权力，踱步至此。\n投来了两百余年岁月中最冷峻的目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"narration","text":"在你看清他的样子之前，他的剑已来到你的跟前。\n阿米娅会死。你不松开阿米娅的话，你也一定会死。\n从踏入这片战场的那一刻起，他就只有一个目标，杀死落入你怀中的“魔王”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i08_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"（极度痛苦的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i08_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希！\n你脱口而出。\n她正濒临死亡。或许下一刻她就会死去。\n你以前从未如此清晰地感受过这种可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"带着阿米娅......撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"（竭尽全力的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"竭尽全力的迎击，也只是将那把貌不惊人的长剑顶开了些许。\n可露希尔拼命拉着你，你抱着阿米娅。\n你们在无人机的拉扯下飞速地后退，而满身鲜血的凯尔希......依旧挡在你们身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（微弱的挣扎）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......你选择了再一次与萨卡兹为敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"两百年前，我看着你重生在特蕾西娅的身边。一度毁灭卡兹戴尔的罪魁祸首，一个驯化古老的不灭之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你为她做了许多事，讲述那些我们永远看不见的遥远幻境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"多遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......你只是在加快毁灭的进程。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，你不能再—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"—唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。但是萨卡兹要快毁灭一步，而不是被你们冷酷的规划夺走生存的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经没有力气说话了。你拦截了巫妖的信使，了不起，军事委员会都还没发现他们的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"但看得出，你们交谈得并不愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我当时警告过你的那样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"我会再杀死你一次，凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]}]}
